# Golden-frame fixtures hold RAW terminal byte streams + their serialized goldens
# (control sequences, CR/LF embedded in the data). They MUST be stored verbatim —
# any EOL normalization (core.autocrlf) would corrupt the bytes so a fresh checkout
# no longer matches what the emulator produces at test time (the §11 golden-frame
# guard reads them latin1 and asserts byte-equality). Treat as binary: no EOL
# conversion, no text diff munging.
*.stream.txt -text
*.golden.txt -text
